    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are pleased to offer for sale to magnificent, detached residence in an ideal location in the popular Knocknacarra area.\n\nDonkell is situated on Ballymoneen Road, adjacent to Knocknacarra church. \n\nOriginally constructed in 2002, the quality detached home comprises of approximately 121.33 sq.m over two stories & is excellently presented by the current owners. \n\nThe ground floor is arranged between a large living area to the front with feature fireplace & leads to a modern kitchen with tiled finishing. \n\nThe back of the house offers a spacious room that with plentiful window space allowing the room to avail of plentiful natural light due to the sought after westerly aspect. This room could be well utilised as a downstairs bedroom. \n\nThe ground floor area is completed via a downstairs bathroom, separate utility space & ample storage. \n\nUpstairs offers a large landing with plentiful adjacent storage. Originally comprising of three bedrooms upstairs, the current layout is arranged between two large bedrooms, both with fitted wardrobes & availing of their own en-suites. \n\nExternally the house offers a cobbled patio encompassing the house with mature planting & hedging. Two sheds are situated on situated in the garden, both with electricity connections. \n\nThe house is offered to the market in excellent condition with quality finished & features throughout such as concrete flooring, new combi boiler, instant hot water & well insulated attic\n\nDonkell house is ideally located within the Knocknacarra residential area. Situated on Ballymoneen Road, adjacent to Knocknacarra Church, with quality transport links to all areas of Galway City are on your doorstep.\n\nLocal amenities such as Tesco supermarket and Gateway Retail Park are within walking distance. \n\nSeveral outdoor landmarks are within walking distance including Rusheen Bay & Woods, Silverstrand, McGrath's Field & Cappagh Playing Fields. \n\nDonkell will be an appealing property for a variety of purchasers looking for quality condition in ideal location.\n\nViewing is highly recommended. \n\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \n\nFor Further details please contact our office on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
      {
